# Planning Rules

- Use `schemas/plan.schema.yaml` and `schemas/task.schema.yaml`.
- Tasks must have: id, type (task), feature_id, plan_id, title, owner (agent name, not role), status. Estimate (S/M/L) recorded in description if not a formal field.
- Task paths: `docs/plans/PLAN-NNN-<slug>.md` for the plan, or per-feature plans per architecture requirements.
- Order tasks by dependency before assigning.
- Owner field maps to agent roster in `.claude/rules/00-team.mdc`.
